::: {.cell}

:::


The Massachusetts Sixth Bristol State Representative District includes parts of Fall River and one precinct in Freetown, with a population of 42,660. The current incumbent is Democrat Carole A. Fiola of Fall River, who has held the seat since winning a special election in September 2013.


